240
00:17:16,775 --> 00:17:22,655
next ten videos are incidents, and each one
starts with you, a generated repository

241
00:17:22,695 --> 00:17:25,080
and a symptom, before any debrief.

242
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:30,603
You now have the whole method: read, preserve,
choose the lowest rung, and verify in

243
00:17:30,643 --> 00:17:35,764
every place the problem existed. Practise
